{"id": "27052", "title": "丽莎的哀怨", "author": "蒋光慈", "category": "文学名著", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/27/27052.htm", "intro": "蒋光慈（1901-1931），现代著名作家。二十年代前期曾留学苏联，1924年回国后，积极倡导革命文学，致力于普罗小说的创作。他是中国无产阶级文学运动中活跃人物之一，是具有代表性的革命小说作家。其小说多以大革命为背景，反映工农群众和青年知识分子的革命斗争。他经常采用“革命加恋爱”的主题，表现历史转变关头革命青年的苦闷、悲愤和奋起抗争的精神世界。", "base": "files/article/html/27/27052", "chapters": [{"title": "一", "file": "1833603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "1833610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "1833621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "1833626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "1833637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "1833641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "1833648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "1833654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "1833670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "1833688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "1833706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "1833729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "1833755.html", "available": false}]}